2 | plan-critic | CHARTER OVERRIDE for this task only: you are NOT reviewing a wave plan. You are a systems designer writing an independent design proposal (Grok seat). Ignore plan-critic VERDICT format except stay rigorous. Read docs/proposals/session-modes-BRIEF.md. Goal: session modes Conductor / Wave / Auto on existing bash+git multi-vendor fleet. Write docs/proposals/session-modes-proposal-grok.md with all required brief sections. Optimize for implementability (inject path, single-seat dispatch, dispatch.sh reuse). Forbidden: invent unverified paths; edit session-modes-proposal-claude.md or session-modes-proposal-kimi.md; implement code. Acceptance: complete proposal file, commit push, draft PR if possible. Write handoff.md before exit. | feat/proposal-session-modes-grok

3 | web-frontend | CHARTER OVERRIDE for this task only: this is NOT a Next.js UI task. Do not edit app components. You are the Kimi seat systems designer writing a design proposal only. Read docs/proposals/session-modes-BRIEF.md. Goal: Conductor / Wave / Auto session modes with low operator friction and strong co-pilot UX. Write docs/proposals/session-modes-proposal-kimi.md covering every required section. Be concrete about activation, day-to-day Conductor flow, and failure modes when a seat is unavailable. Forbidden: invent auth paths or CLI flags; touch session-modes-proposal-claude.md or session-modes-proposal-grok.md; implement product UI. Acceptance: proposal file complete, commit push, draft PR if possible. Write handoff.md before exit. | feat/proposal-session-modes-kimi
